@startuml 
title AI Chat Flow

!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2

actor Client
participant GatewayService
participant AIService
participant VectorService
participant LLMService
participant TradeReportsConsumer
database ChromaDB
participant Ollama
queue Kafka

Client -> GatewayService: POST /api/ai/chat\n(ChatRequest)
activate GatewayService

GatewayService -> AIService: POST /api/ai/chat\n(ChatRequest)
activate AIService

AIService -> VectorService: search_similar(query, limit, min_similarity)
activate VectorService

VectorService -> ChromaDB: Vector search
ChromaDB --> VectorService: Similar trades
VectorService --> AIService: List<Document>
deactivate VectorService

alt Similar trades found
    AIService -> LLMService: generate_response(query, similar_trades)
    activate LLMService
    
    LLMService -> LLMService: build_context(similar_trades)
    
    LLMService -> Ollama: POST /api/generate\n(prompt)
    activate Ollama
    Ollama --> LLMService: Generated response
    deactivate Ollama
    
    LLMService --> AIService: Response text
    deactivate LLMService
    
AIService --> GatewayService: ChatResponse\n(response, sources, session_id)
deactivate AIService

GatewayService --> Client: 200 OK\nChatResponse
deactivate GatewayService


Kafka -> TradeReportsConsumer: Trade event
activate TradeReportsConsumer

TradeReportsConsumer -> VectorService: add_document(document)
activate VectorService
VectorService -> ChromaDB: Store vector embedding
ChromaDB --> VectorService: Document stored
VectorService --> TradeReportsConsumer: Success
deactivate VectorService

deactivate TradeReportsConsumer

@enduml

